<MainLayout title="Yoyo | 叶菜洁净包装一体化机器">

<Navbar />

<section class="project-page">

<a class="back-link" href="/resume">← 返回简历 <span class="en">← Back to Resume</span></a>

<div class="hero">
<div class="hero-icon">🥬</div>
<h1>
叶菜洁净包装一体化机器设计
<span class="en">Leafy Vegetable Cleaning & Packaging Integrated Machine Design</span>
</h1>
<p>
上海机械工程创新设计大赛 · 上海市二等奖
<span class="en">Shanghai Mechanical Engineering Innovation Design Competition · Shanghai Second Prize</span>
</p>
</div>

<section class="card">
<h2>
项目概述
<span class="en">Project Overview</span>
</h2>
<p>
本项目针对叶菜类蔬菜在采后处理环节中的清洗与包装效率问题，设计并实现了一台洁净包装一体化机器。该机器将清洗、沥干、包装三道工序集成于一体，旨在提高叶菜采后处理的自动化程度，减少人工接触与二次污染，保障食品安全。
<span class="en">This project addresses the efficiency of cleaning and packaging in post-harvest processing of leafy vegetables. We designed and built an integrated machine combining cleaning, draining, and packaging into one unit, aiming to improve automation, reduce manual contact and secondary contamination, and ensure food safety.</span>
</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
项目亮点
<span class="en">Project Highlights</span>
</h2>
<ul>
<li>
清洗模块：多级水流冲洗与气泡清洗结合，有效去除泥沙与农残
<span class="en">Cleaning module: multi-stage water rinsing combined with bubble cleaning for effective removal of soil and pesticide residue</span>
</li>
<li>
沥干模块：振动沥水与风干结合，降低叶菜表面含水率
<span class="en">Draining module: vibration draining combined with air drying to reduce surface moisture</span>
</li>
<li>
包装模块：自动送料与密封包装，适配多种叶菜规格
<span class="en">Packaging module: automatic feeding and sealing, adaptable to various leafy vegetable sizes</span>
</li>
<li>
一体化设计：三工序无缝衔接，结构紧凑，适合中小型农场与加工厂
<span class="en">Integrated design: seamless process integration, compact structure, suitable for small-to-medium farms and processing facilities</span>
</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
我的角色
<span class="en">My Role</span>
</h2>
<ul>
<li>
机械结构设计：负责整机方案设计与三维建模
<span class="en">Mechanical structure design: responsible for overall machine design and 3D modeling</span>
</li>
<li>
传动系统设计：电机选型、传动比计算与部件适配
<span class="en">Transmission system design: motor selection, gear ratio calculation, and component adaptation</span>
</li>
<li>
样机调试与性能验证：参与样机组装、功能测试与力学性能优化
<span class="en">Prototype debugging and performance verification: participated in assembly, functional testing, and mechanical optimization</span>
</li>
<li>
竞赛答辩与材料撰写：负责技术文档与答辩展示
<span class="en">Competition defense and documentation: responsible for technical documentation and presentation</span>
</li>
</ul>
</section>

